    "effect": "An invaluable guide to patient care, praised by rangers and others who need to administer first-aid on the job.\nRank 1 – Novice Medicine Education: After taking a Sprint Maneuver, you may apply a Restorative Item on an adjacent target as a Rapid Action.\nRank 2 – Expert Medicine Education: Once per Scene as a Standard Action, you may target an adjacent ally. The target may immediately Take a Breather as a Full-Action Interrupt if they wish. They do not Shift and do not become Tripped as part of this action. If the target is Confused or Enraged, you must make a Medicine Education Check with a DC of 12 for them to be able to Take a Breather.",
